== Overview ==
The '''Glitch Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] that only appears in [[Nightmare Mode]] or [[Endless Mode]]. It was formerly the boss for Nightmare Mode, but now first appears on Wave 47. It has lots of health and is the second fastest toilet in the game, only surpassed by [[Cat Toilet]].
== Appearance ==
'''Glitch Toilet''' is a toilet that has a black toilet bowl that is covered with armor and the water tank is futuristic. It is very fast and also has a blue electric/lightning trail as it moves.
